<v Orlando>they can go back to our lessons and follow
along a little bit closer in our consonants.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.130
<v Michelle>Yes, that's all right.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.950
<v Orlando>That's the end of supplementary lesson number two.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:20.870
<v Valdo>Yeah, thank you.

